remière fois, lui et Gwen Stacy découvrent les sentiments, l’engagement et les secrets. En retrouvant une mystérieuse mallette ayant appartenu à son père, Peter entame une quête pour élucider la disparition de ses parents, ce qui le conduit rapidement à Oscorp et au laboratoire du docteur Curt Connors, l’ancien associé de son père. Spider-Man va bientôt se retrouver face au Lézard, l’alter ego de Connors. En décidant d’utiliser ses pouvoirs, il va choisir son destin…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/q5AEX2vfyibDKnaMiXHzkm49zgF.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sxskOU71CO8LaNX2LOtjYFUtKv7.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.8,"vote_count":19369,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2012","release_date":"2012-06-23","runtime_minutes":136,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","مغامرة","خيال علمي","أفلام"],"genre_keys":["action","adventure","scifi"],"similar":["mv1061474","mv102382","mv412656","mv209112","mv121856","mv436969","mv287947","mv83542"],"director":"Marc Webb","cast":[{"name":"أندرو غارفيلد","character":"Spider-Man / Peter Parker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/beO5YvbTjrr5yy8hW26KVDMSr35.jpg"},{"name":"إيما ستون","character":"Gwen Stacy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ak2Y9wOI3wi2pNQU6OWSvVvWPj5.jpg"},{"name":"ريس ايفانز","character":"The Lizard / Dr. Curt Connors","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5X8XcIqCDxsQYyHdx7mBwPVkSTs.jpg"},{"name":"دينيس ليري","character":"Captain Stacy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tAOziVWQBnrW9eR442M6g9SQkmA.jpg"},{"name":"مارتن شين","character":"Uncle Ben","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/m2Y3Q0uyuW6htrn2W9UWCWMkpZu.jpg"},{"name":"Sally Field","character":"Aunt May","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iMeq1j9Xwvaf6PbTJ0FQz69fpuA.jpg"},{"name":"Irrfan Khan","character":"Rajit Ratha","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qkA9PpWJRw3rNjVkWfNZdwLvRZx.jpg"},{"name":"كامبل سكوت","character":"Richard Parker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1kj769jco2U73xasSEu0TyX9I5w.jpg"},{"name":"إيمبث ديفيدتز","character":"Mary Parker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nwsdu9lOsKJ5v9RwOCc7kAiuxSO.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Zylka","character":"Flash Thompson","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8ctswPqjqNpDPxW792xnHEZnWwA.jpg"}],"trailer_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WLxul0Vzuhk","seasons_count":null,"episodes_count":null,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"beINMovies2Action.qa@SD","start":"2026-11-17T02:30:00Z","stop":"2026-11-17T04:45:00Z","start_ts":1794882600,"stop_ts":1794890700,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv102382":{"show_id":"mv102382","tmdb_id":102382,"content_type":"movie","title":"الرجل العنكبوت المذهل 2","title_en":"The Amazing Spider-Man 2","title_fr":"The Amazing Spider-Man : Le Destin d'un héros","original_title":"The Amazing Spider-Man 2","tagline":"تبدأ معركته الكبرى.","description":"عندما تُحاصر شركة أوسكورب مدينة نيويورك، يقع على عاتق سبايدرمان إنقاذ المدينة التي أقسم على حمايتها، بالإضافة إلى إنقاذ أحبائه.","description_en":"For Peter Parker, life is busy. Between taking out the bad guys as Spider-Man and spending time with the person he loves, Gwen Stacy, high school graduation cannot come quickly enough. Peter has not forgotten about the promise he made to Gwen’s father to protect her by staying away, but that is a promise he cannot keep. Things will change for Peter when a new villain, Electro, emerges, an old friend, Harry Osborn, returns, and Peter uncovers new clues about his past.","description_fr":"Peter Parker a une vie très occupée partagée entre son combat contre les vilains et la personne qu’il aime, Gwen. Il attend donc son diplôme de fin de lycée avec impatience. Peter n’a pas oublié la promesse qu’il a faite au père de Gwen : la protéger en restant hors de son existence. Une promesse qu’il ne peut pas tenir. Les choses vont changer pour Peter quand un nouveau v